## Reproduce
```bash
OODAC=/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA/ooda/oodac/oodac
# named sink value (Z2)
$OODAC emit-c   ooda/fixtures/secret_setenv_fail.oo   # ERR secret setenv token
$OODAC emit-llvm ooda/fixtures/secret_setenv_fail.oo  # ERR secret setenv token
$OODAC check    ooda/fixtures/secret_setenv_fail.oo   # ERR type undefined setenv
# env_set value (ephemeral shape)
# // SECRET: token
# pub fn main(envc: &EnvCap) { let token = "s3cret"; env_set(envc, "KEY", token); }
# emit-c / emit-llvm → ERR secret env_set sink refuses SECRET token
# Z3: public stmt setenv emits libc-shaped call; gcc type-fails
# emit-c of `setenv("KEY","public",1)` contains:
#   setenv(oo_str_lit("KEY"), oo_str_lit("public"), 1LL);
# a0 residual (R2): emit-llvm of setenv(token, "1", 1) → rc=0 + call @setenv(%OoStr)
```

